# Build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED: this workspace ships a binary (modelpipe-cli),
# so reproducible builds win over the library convention of ignoring it.
# Do not add Cargo.lock here.

# Coverage / profiling output
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph.svg

# Secrets — nothing here should ever be a committed file, but tokens and
# tickets are this crate's whole business, so make the mistake harder.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Local AI/assistant tooling — never tracked. Carried over from gglib, where
# these directories are scratch space for coding assistants (session state,
# worktrees, handoff notes). They are machine-local and must not enter history.
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/
.codeium/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Editors / tooling
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.iml
.direnv/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
